<span id="S4.T2.2.3.2.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S4.T2.2.3.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">MetaMathQA </span><cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep"><span id="S4.T2.2.3.2.1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">(</span><a href="#bib.bib62" title="" class="ltx_ref">Yu et al., 2023</a><span id="S4.T2.2.3.2.1.1.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">)</span></cite></span>
</span></td>
<td id="S4.T2.2.3.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_bb ltx_border_t">
<span id="S4.T2.2.3.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:71.1pt;">
<span id="S4.T2.2.3.3.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S4.T2.2.3.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Math </span><cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep"><span id="S4.T2.2.3.3.1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">(</span><a href="#bib.bib22" title="" class="ltx_ref">Hendrycks et al., 2021c</a><span id="S4.T2.2.3.3.1.1.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">)</span></cite></span>
</span></td>
<td id="S4.T2.2.3.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_bb ltx_border_t">
<span id="S4.T2.2.3.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:71.1pt;">
<span id="S4.T2.2.3.4.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S4.T2.2.3.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Curated Domains (Pre-Algebra, Algebra, Counting, and Probability)</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="S4.T2.2.3.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_bb ltx_border_t">
<span id="S4.T2.2.3.5.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:71.1pt;">
<span id="S4.T2.2.3.5.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S4.T2.2.3.5.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Math (Pre-Algebra, Algebra, Counting, and Probability)</span></span>
